:: StoryTitle
One more cup

:: StoryData
{"ifid":"DB0A0310-85B7-4CDA-A2B0-000000000003","format":"SugarCube","format-version":"2.37.3","start":"Start"}

:: StoryScript [script]
setup.episode={"id":"teahouse","version":1,"title":"One more cup","subtitle":"Introduce two people. Let the afternoon change.","place":"Teahouse","newWords":["同事","下雨","等一下"],"ending":"Rain taps the roof while I finish my tea. I have introduced people, asked questions, and changed a plan. My Chinese is still small. The afternoon has made room for it.","scenes":[{"title":"The right table","speaker":"zhou","paragraphs":["I step into the neighbourhood teahouse. Ms Zhou, the owner, catches a cup before it rolls off a tray. She looks pleased that I have not arrived during the catching part.","Chen is nearby, looking for a table. Ms Lin is already here after shopping. Whether invited or simply passing through, she has found the best chair."],"line":{"zh":"你好！请坐。喝什么茶？","english":"Hello! Please sit. What tea would you like?","pinyin":"nǐ hǎo ！ qǐng zuò 。 hē shén me chá ？","audio":"audio/eeaf2b6aec584771d199.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"hot","label":"Ask for hot tea","simple":{"chunks":["我","想喝","热茶"],"english":"I would like hot tea.","pinyin":["wǒ","xiǎng hē","rè chá"],"audio":"audio/22f323e39608b5bf984f.m4a"},"response":"Ms Zhou sets out a warm cup. Steam curls upward while I take off my bag.","hint":"想喝 goes before the drink.","rich":{"chunks":["我","想要","一杯","热茶"],"english":"I would like a cup of hot tea.","pinyin":["wǒ","xiǎng yào","yì bēi","rè chá"],"audio":"audio/281e5ee3c7bab8770e06.m4a"}},{"id":"water","label":"Ask for water first","simple":{"chunks":["请","给我","一杯水"],"english":"Please give me a glass of water.","pinyin":["qǐng","gěi wǒ","yì bēi shuǐ"],"audio":"audio/02c7ed0e30709dca5888.m4a"},"response":"Water arrives without fuss. I have time to settle in before choosing tea.","hint":"请 softens the request; the drink follows 给我.","rich":{"chunks":["请","给我","一杯水"],"english":"Please give me a glass of water.","pinyin":["qǐng","gěi wǒ","yì bēi shuǐ"],"audio":"audio/02c7ed0e30709dca5888.m4a"}}],"aside":{"question":"Notice the room","answer":"Bamboo chairs scrape gently across the floor. Nobody seems in a hurry to make a cup of tea into a schedule."},"callback":{"flag":"three","text":"My phone shows the three-o’clock meeting I arranged with Chen. This time our calendars and our feet agree."},"id":"exchange-1"},{"title":"Put two names together","speaker":"lin","paragraphs":["Ms Lin waves Chen toward our table. He looks at me, waiting for an introduction.","I know who everyone is. They do not. This is a small piece of useful Chinese I can supply."],"line":{"zh":"这是谁？","english":"Who is this?","pinyin":"zhè shì shuí ？","audio":"audio/775dc10fc61ad247d4be.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"colleague","label":"Introduce Chen as my colleague","simple":{"chunks":["这是","我的","同事"],"english":"This is my colleague.","pinyin":["zhè shì","wǒ de","tóng shì"],"audio":"audio/e2da8447c1768536213b.m4a"},"response":"Chen introduces himself. Ms Lin makes room for his chair, and I no longer have to carry both sides of the conversation.","hint":"我的 describes 同事; keep those together.","rich":{"chunks":["这是","我的同事","他","姓陈"],"english":"This is my colleague; his surname is Chen.","pinyin":["zhè shì","wǒ de tóng shì","tā","xìng chén"],"audio":"audio/13d853d7cd050b04a1ab.m4a"}}],"aside":{"question":"Introduce Ms Lin too","answer":"I gesture toward Ms Lin and say her name. Chen greets her. Names and a welcoming gesture do some of the work while I learn the longer sentence."},"id":"exchange-2"},{"title":"The question comes back","speaker":"chen","paragraphs":["Chen asks Ms Lin about the book beside her cup. She tells him it belongs to the owner.","The question turns back toward me. I can ask Chen about reading, or include Ms Lin by asking about tea."],"line":{"zh":"你想聊什么？","english":"What would you like to talk about?","pinyin":"nǐ xiǎng liáo shén me ？","audio":"audio/997d002d4720760bf695.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"reading","label":"Ask Chen about reading","simple":{"chunks":["你","喜欢","看书","吗"],"english":"Do you like reading?","pinyin":["nǐ","xǐ huan","kàn shū","ma"],"audio":"audio/8c004620ddf95d710f38.m4a"},"response":"Chen leans forward. He describes a book in short sentences, checking that I can follow.","hint":"Put 吗 at the end.","rich":{"chunks":["你","喜欢","看书","吗"],"english":"Do you like reading?","pinyin":["nǐ","xǐ huan","kàn shū","ma"],"audio":"audio/8c004620ddf95d710f38.m4a"},"flag":"asked-books"},{"id":"tea","label":"Ask Ms Lin about tea","simple":{"chunks":["你","喜欢","喝茶","吗"],"english":"Do you like drinking tea?","pinyin":["nǐ","xǐ huan","hē chá","ma"],"audio":"audio/710428c0164320b8ee7a.m4a"},"response":"Ms Lin lifts her cup with a theatrical seriousness. Even before the answer, I understand her position.","hint":"Put 吗 at the end.","rich":{"chunks":["你","喜欢","喝茶","吗"],"english":"Do you like drinking tea?","pinyin":["nǐ","xǐ huan","hē chá","ma"],"audio":"audio/710428c0164320b8ee7a.m4a"},"flag":"asked-tea"}],"aside":{"question":"Ask a follow-up about the book","answer":"Chen shows me the cover rather than reciting a complicated summary. I can ask someone to show me something as well as explain it."},"callback":{"flag":"books","text":"I remember telling Chen that I like reading. He has brought a book to show me; our last conversation has travelled with him."},"id":"exchange-3"},{"title":"One detail about my life","speaker":"lin","paragraphs":["Ms Lin points to Chen’s book and remembers the books in my bag outside the courtyard.","She asks about school. I can explain what I teach or where I work. There is no need to list every class."],"line":{"zh":"你教什么？","english":"What do you teach?","pinyin":"nǐ jiào shén me ？","audio":"audio/043b0d238f0abe1481b7.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"english","label":"Say that I teach English","simple":{"chunks":["我","教","英语"],"english":"I teach English.","pinyin":["wǒ","jiào","yīng yǔ"],"audio":"audio/48af3b5c68be5c4d5afd.m4a"},"response":"Chen nods, then slowly tells Ms Lin that we work together. A familiar fact becomes a conversation among three people.","hint":"教 is the verb; 英语 is what I teach.","rich":{"chunks":["我","在学校","教","英语"],"english":"I teach English at school.","pinyin":["wǒ","zài xué xiào","jiào","yīng yǔ"],"audio":"audio/9df506df76f132bb2d65.m4a"}},{"id":"teacher","label":"Explain that I am a teacher","simple":{"chunks":["我","是","英语老师"],"english":"I am an English teacher.","pinyin":["wǒ","shì","yīng yǔ lǎo shī"],"audio":"audio/6550f64fef56edd93900.m4a"},"response":"Ms Lin remembers the courtyard conversation. This time I say the sentence without searching quite so hard.","hint":"是 links 我 with the occupation.","rich":{"chunks":["我","是","英语老师"],"english":"I am an English teacher.","pinyin":["wǒ","shì","yīng yǔ lǎo shī"],"audio":"audio/6550f64fef56edd93900.m4a"}}],"aside":{"question":"Notice the callback","answer":"I have used the same idea in two places now. The person listening has changed; the sentence still works."},"id":"exchange-4"},{"title":"A word under the rain","speaker":"zhou","paragraphs":["A sudden pattering begins on the roof. Ms Zhou looks outside and says something while moving a chair away from the doorway.","I hear the first words, then rain swallows the rest. This is exactly what a request for repetition is for."],"line":{"zh":"下雨了。等一下再走吧。","english":"It is raining. Wait a little before leaving.","pinyin":"xià yǔ le 。 děng yí xià zài zǒu ba 。","audio":"audio/2602e6c7d2a94562b99d.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"repeat","label":"Ask Ms Zhou to repeat that","simple":{"chunks":["请","再说","一遍"],"english":"Please say it again.","pinyin":["qǐng","zài shuō","yí biàn"],"audio":"audio/a65bbc3864b52e5a91e4.m4a"},"response":"She points to the rain, then the dry chairs, and repeats herself. The room supplies clues as well as words.","hint":"再 goes before 说; 一遍 finishes the request.","rich":{"chunks":["请","再说","一遍"],"english":"Please say it again.","pinyin":["qǐng","zài shuō","yí biàn"],"audio":"audio/a65bbc3864b52e5a91e4.m4a"}},{"id":"slow","label":"Ask her to speak more slowly","simple":{"chunks":["请","说","慢一点"],"english":"Please speak a little more slowly.","pinyin":["qǐng","shuō","màn yì diǎn"],"audio":"audio/c49dc06bd705315e47ea.m4a"},"response":"She repeats it more slowly. I catch both the weather and her practical suggestion.","hint":"慢一点 follows 说.","rich":{"chunks":["请","说","慢一点"],"english":"Please speak a little more slowly.","pinyin":["qǐng","shuō","màn yì diǎn"],"audio":"audio/c49dc06bd705315e47ea.m4a"}}],"aside":{"question":"Look outside","answer":"The courtyard stones are darkening. Waiting here would be comfortable; leaving would mean finding an umbrella."},"id":"exchange-5"},{"title":"Change the plan","speaker":"chen","paragraphs":["Chen looks at the rain, then at the nearly empty teapot. We had thought about a walk. The weather has another suggestion.","I can propose waiting here or asking for an umbrella. Both keep the afternoon moving, in different ways."],"line":{"zh":"我们现在走吗？","english":"Shall we leave now?","pinyin":"wǒ men xiàn zài zǒu ma ？","audio":"audio/4bd7a3dcf9b700b7dc82.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"wait","label":"Suggest waiting here a little","simple":{"chunks":["我们","在这里","等一下","吧"],"english":"Let’s wait here a little.","pinyin":["wǒ men","zài zhè lǐ","děng yí xià","ba"],"audio":"audio/a7924557b8be4ce5fb82.m4a"},"response":"Ms Zhou refills the pot. The walk becomes a longer conversation, which was most of the point anyway.","hint":"Place 在这里 before 等一下.","rich":{"chunks":["我们","在这里","等一下","吧"],"english":"Let’s wait here a little.","pinyin":["wǒ men","zài zhè lǐ","děng yí xià","ba"],"audio":"audio/a7924557b8be4ce5fb82.m4a"},"flag":"wait"},{"id":"umbrella","label":"Suggest borrowing an umbrella","simple":{"chunks":["我们","借一把伞","再走","吧"],"english":"Let’s borrow an umbrella before leaving.","pinyin":["wǒ men","jiè yì bǎ sǎn","zài zǒu","ba"],"audio":"audio/cc9cee1394b5f56eb577.m4a"},"response":"Ms Zhou points to a spare umbrella. We agree to return it; the next visit now has a small purpose.","hint":"再走 comes after borrowing the umbrella.","rich":{"chunks":["我们","借一把伞","再走","吧"],"english":"Let’s borrow an umbrella before leaving.","pinyin":["wǒ men","jiè yì bǎ sǎn","zài zǒu","ba"],"audio":"audio/cc9cee1394b5f56eb577.m4a"},"flag":"umbrella"}],"aside":{"question":"Consider what matters","answer":"The afternoon does not need to follow the original plan to go well. I need language for changing it together."},"id":"exchange-6"},{"title":"Leave the next conversation open","speaker":"zhou","paragraphs":["Eventually the rain softens. I have my bag, Chen has his book, and Ms Lin has somehow acquired another spring onion.","I want to thank Ms Zhou and leave warmly. I do not need a perfect final speech. I need something I can say again next time."],"line":{"zh":"下次再来！","english":"Come again next time!","pinyin":"xià cì zài lái ！","audio":"audio/daf7df94f19b31b01d53.m4a"},"choices":[{"id":"thanks","label":"Thank her and say goodbye","simple":{"chunks":["谢谢","我们","下次","再见"],"english":"Thank you; see you next time.","pinyin":["xiè xiè","wǒ men","xià cì","zài jiàn"],"audio":"audio/60bc62ae0128737b1871.m4a"},"response":"Ms Zhou waves from the doorway. The next greeting already feels a little easier.","hint":"下次 sets the time for 再见.","rich":{"chunks":["谢谢","我们","下次","再见"],"english":"Thank you; see you next time.","pinyin":["xiè xiè","wǒ men","xià cì","zài jiàn"],"audio":"audio/60bc62ae0128737b1871.m4a"}},{"id":"again","label":"Suggest tea together again","simple":{"chunks":["我们","下次","一起喝茶","吧"],"english":"Let’s have tea together next time.","pinyin":["wǒ men","xià cì","yì qǐ hē chá","ba"],"audio":"audio/20b577baea2589a848ad.m4a"},"response":"Ms Lin raises one finger as if putting it straight into her calendar. Chen laughs and checks which day she means.","hint":"Keep 吧 at the end of the suggestion.","rich":{"chunks":["我们","下次","一起喝茶","吧"],"english":"Let’s have tea together next time.","pinyin":["wǒ men","xià cì","yì qǐ hē chá","ba"],"audio":"audio/20b577baea2589a848ad.m4a"}}],"aside":{"question":"Recall the afternoon","answer":"I introduced a colleague, asked about an interest, explained my work, and asked for repetition. Familiar pieces made a new conversation."},"id":"exchange-7"}],"resources":["teahouse.html","courtyard.webp","characters.webp","audio/eeaf2b6aec584771d199.m4a","audio/22f323e39608b5bf984f.m4a","audio/281e5ee3c7bab8770e06.m4a","audio/02c7ed0e30709dca5888.m4a","audio/775dc10fc61ad247d4be.m4a","audio/e2da8447c1768536213b.m4a","audio/13d853d7cd050b04a1ab.m4a","audio/997d002d4720760bf695.m4a","audio/8c004620ddf95d710f38.m4a","audio/710428c0164320b8ee7a.m4a","audio/043b0d238f0abe1481b7.m4a","audio/48af3b5c68be5c4d5afd.m4a","audio/9df506df76f132bb2d65.m4a","audio/6550f64fef56edd93900.m4a","audio/2602e6c7d2a94562b99d.m4a","audio/a65bbc3864b52e5a91e4.m4a","audio/c49dc06bd705315e47ea.m4a","audio/4bd7a3dcf9b700b7dc82.m4a","audio/a7924557b8be4ce5fb82.m4a","audio/cc9cee1394b5f56eb577.m4a","audio/daf7df94f19b31b01d53.m4a","audio/60bc62ae0128737b1871.m4a","audio/20b577baea2589a848ad.m4a"]};
/* Presentation only. The parent owns identity, validation, audio and local saves. */
Config.history.maxStates = 1;
Config.history.controls = false;
Config.saves.isAllowed = () => false;
Config.ui.stowBarInitially = true;
Config.passages.nobr = true;
const channel = new URLSearchParams(location.hash.slice(1)).get('channel');
let snapshot = null;
let pending = false;
let hotkeys = ['1','2','3','4','5','6'];
let playKey = 'p';
const characters = {lin:['Ms Lin · my neighbour',0],chen:['Chen · my colleague',1],zhou:['Ms Zhou · teahouse owner',2]};
function send(type, payload = {}) {
  if (parent === window || !channel) return;
  parent.postMessage({protocol:'chunky-game-v1',channel,type,...payload},location.origin);
}
function act(type, extra = {}) { if(pending)return;pending=true;send('action',{revision:snapshot.revision,action:{type,...extra}}); }
function el(tag, text, cls) { const n=document.createElement(tag); if(text!==undefined)n.textContent=text; if(cls)n.className=cls; return n; }
function button(label, fn, key) { const b=el('button',label); b.type='button'; b.onclick=fn; if(key)b.dataset.key=key; return b; }
function speak(audio) { if(audio)send('audio',{audio}); }
function zhLine(line, root) {
  const p=el('p',line.zh,'chinese'); p.lang='zh-CN'; root.append(p);
  if(snapshot.pinyin)root.append(el('p',line.pinyin,'pinyin'));
  root.append(button('▶ Hear Mandarin',()=>speak(line.audio),'hear'));
  root.append(button(snapshot.meaning?'Hide meaning':'Show meaning',()=>act('meaning'),'meaning'));
  if(snapshot.meaning)root.append(el('p',line.english,'translation'));
}
function render(root) {
  root.replaceChildren();
  if (!snapshot) { root.append(el('p',parent===window?'Open this episode from Game in Chunky Chinese to save your progress.':'Opening your conversation…')); return; }
  const a=snapshot, ep=setup.episode, scene=ep.scenes[a.step];
  if(!scene) {
    root.append(el('p','EPISODE COMPLETE','eyebrow'),el('h1','Things I can now say'),el('p',ep.ending));
    a.results.forEach((r,i)=>{const c=ep.scenes[i].choices.find(c=>c.id===r.choiceId),ans=c[a.variant];const card=el('section',undefined,'receipt');const line=el('p',ans.chunks.join(''),'chinese');line.lang='zh-CN';card.append(line,el('p',ans.english),el('small',r.independent?'Independently':'With support'),button('▶ Hear my sentence',()=>speak(ans.audio)));root.append(card)});
    root.append(el('p','Recognition guides difficulty; these conversations do not change your flashcard ratings.'),button('Back to Game',()=>send('exit'),'exit'));
    return;
  }
  const char=characters[scene.speaker];
  const c=scene.choices.find(c=>c.id===a.choiceId);
  const art=el('div',undefined,'scene-art');
  const portrait=el('img',undefined,'portrait');portrait.src='characters.webp';portrait.alt='';portrait.style.setProperty('--person',char[1]);portrait.onerror=()=>portrait.remove();
  // A clipped atlas shows only the current interlocutor, with their name as fallback.
  const crop=el('div',undefined,'portrait-crop');crop.append(portrait);art.append(crop,el('span',ep.place,'place'));root.append(art);
  const panel=el('section',undefined,'dialogue');
  panel.append(el('p',`${a.step+1} / ${ep.scenes.length} · ${char[0]}`,'eyebrow'));
  const heading=el('h1',scene.title);heading.tabIndex=-1;panel.append(heading);
  if(scene.callback && a.callbacks.includes(scene.callback.flag))panel.append(el('p',scene.callback.text,'callback'));
  // Assistive technology gets the full narrative immediately; visual pacing is optional.
  if(c){const moment=el('details');moment.append(el('summary','Recall this moment'),el('p',scene.paragraphs.join(' ')));panel.append(moment)}
  else {const sr=el('div',scene.paragraphs.join(' '),'sr-only');panel.append(sr);
  scene.paragraphs.slice(0,a.paragraph+1).forEach(t=>{const p=el('p',t);p.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');panel.append(p)})}
  if(a.paragraph<scene.paragraphs.length) {
    panel.append(button('Next',()=>act('reveal'),'next'),button('Show all',()=>act('showAll'),'showAll'));root.append(panel);return;
  }
  zhLine(scene.line,panel);
  panel.append(button(a.pinyin?'Pinyin: on':'Pinyin: off',()=>act('pinyin'),'pinyin'));
  const aside=el('section',undefined,'aside');aside.append(button(scene.aside.question,()=>act('aside'),'aside'));if(a.aside)aside.append(el('p',scene.aside.answer));if(!c)panel.append(aside);
  const recall=el('details');recall.append(el('summary','Recall the conversation'));
  a.results.forEach((r,i)=>{const s=ep.scenes[i],c=s.choices.find(c=>c.id===r.choiceId);recall.append(el('p',`${s.line.zh} — ${c[a.variant].chunks.join('')}`),el('p',c.response))});
  if(!a.results.length)recall.append(el('p',scene.paragraphs.join(' ')));if(!c)panel.append(recall);
  if(!c) {
    panel.append(el('h2','What do I want to say?'));
    scene.choices.forEach((choice,i)=>{const b=button(`${i+1}. ${choice.label}`,()=>act('choose',{choiceId:choice.id}),`choice-${i}`);b.dataset.shortcut=hotkeys[i];panel.append(b)});
  } else {
    const answer=c[a.variant];
    panel.append(el('h2',c.label),el('p',answer.english,'intention'));
    const selected=el('div',undefined,'sentence');selected.setAttribute('aria-label','My sentence');
    a.tiles.forEach((id,pos)=>{const b=button(answer.chunks[id],()=>act('remove',{index:pos}),`remove-${pos}`);b.lang='zh-CN';b.disabled=a.solved;b.setAttribute('aria-label',`Remove ${answer.chunks[id]}`);selected.append(b)});
    if(!a.tiles.length)selected.append(el('span','Tap chunks below to build your reply.','empty'));panel.append(selected);
    const bank=el('div',undefined,'chunks');bank.setAttribute('aria-label','Available chunks');
    const order=answer.chunks.map((_,i)=>i).reverse();
    order.forEach((id,pos)=>{const b=button('',()=>act('tile',{index:id}),`tile-${id}`);b.disabled=a.tiles.includes(id)||a.solved;b.dataset.shortcut=hotkeys[pos];b.append(el('small',String(pos+1)),el('span',answer.chunks[id]));b.lang='zh-CN';if(a.pinyin)b.append(el('small',answer.pinyin[id]));bank.append(b)});panel.append(bank);
    const controls=el('div',undefined,'controls');
    if(!a.solved) {
      controls.append(button('Undo',()=>act('undo'),'undo'),button('Clear',()=>act('clear'),'clear'),button('Hint',()=>act('hint'),'hint'),button('Check',()=>act('check'),'check'));
      if(a.errors>=2)controls.append(button('Show worked answer',()=>act('model'),'model'));
    }
    panel.append(controls);
    if(a.feedback){const f=el('p',a.feedback,'feedback');f.setAttribute('role','status');panel.append(f)}
    if(a.solved){panel.append(el('p',c.response,'response'),button('▶ Hear my reply',()=>speak(answer.audio),'reply'),button(a.step===ep.scenes.length-1?'Finish episode':'Continue',()=>act('next'),'continue'))}
    panel.append(el('small','Keys 1–5 choose chunks. Tab moves between controls. P replays the speaker.','keyboard-help'));
  }
  if(c){const more=el('details');more.append(el('summary','More conversation & recall'),aside,recall);panel.append(more)}
  root.append(panel);
}
Macro.add('chengduScene',{handler:function(){const root=el('main',undefined,'chengdu');this.output.append(root);render(root)}});
window.addEventListener('message',event=>{
  const m=event.data;
  if(event.source!==parent||event.origin!==location.origin||m?.protocol!=='chunky-game-v1'||m.channel!==channel||m.type!=='state'||!m.state||m.state.episodeId!==setup.episode.id||m.state.version!==setup.episode.version)return;
  pending=false;
  const before=snapshot;
  snapshot=m.state;
  if(Array.isArray(m.hotkeys))hotkeys=m.hotkeys;
  if(typeof m.playKey==='string')playKey=m.playKey;
  const passage=snapshot.step===setup.episode.scenes.length?'Ending':`Scene${snapshot.step+1}`;
  const focusKey=document.activeElement?.dataset?.key;
  if(State.passage!==passage)Engine.play(passage);
  else {const root=document.querySelector('.chengdu');if(root)render(root)}
  if(before && (before.step!==snapshot.step || (!before.choiceId && snapshot.choiceId)))window.scrollTo(0,0);
  if(before){const controls=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button'));const focus=controls.find(b=>b.dataset.key===focusKey&&!b.disabled)||controls.find(b=>b.dataset.key==='continue')||controls.find(b=>b.dataset.shortcut&&!b.disabled)||document.querySelector('h1');focus?.focus({preventScroll:true})}
});
window.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{
  if(event.ctrlKey||event.metaKey||event.altKey||event.repeat||!snapshot)return;
  if(event.key.toLowerCase()===playKey.toLowerCase()){event.preventDefault();speak(setup.episode.scenes[snapshot.step]?.line.audio);return}
  const b=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button[data-shortcut]')).find(b=>b.dataset.shortcut?.toLowerCase()===event.key.toLowerCase()&&!b.disabled);
  if(b){event.preventDefault();b.click()}
});
$(document).one(':storyready',()=>send('ready'));


:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]
:root{color-scheme:light;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:#253b32;background:#f5efdf}body{margin:0;background:#f5efdf;color:#253b32}#ui-bar,#story-title{display:none}#story{margin:0;padding:0}#passages{max-width:820px;margin:auto}.passage{padding:0}.chengdu{padding:0 0 24px}.scene-art{height:205px;position:relative;background:#b9c9a3 url('courtyard.webp') center 52%/cover;image-rendering:pixelated;border-bottom:5px solid #37654a;overflow:hidden}.portrait-crop{position:absolute;width:97px;height:194px;bottom:0;right:12%;overflow:hidden}.portrait{height:194px;width:291px;max-width:none;position:absolute;left:calc(var(--person) * -97px);image-rendering:pixelated}.place{position:absolute;left:18px;top:18px;background:#183d30;color:#fff6df;padding:8px 15px;border:2px solid #dbba75;font-weight:700}.dialogue,.chengdu>h1,.chengdu>p,.receipt{margin:0;padding:18px 24px}.dialogue p{line-height:1.65;margin:10px 0}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#456251}.dialogue h1,.chengdu>h1{font-size:25px;line-height:1.2;margin:10px 0 18px}h2{font-size:18px;margin-top:22px}.chinese{font-size:25px!important;line-height:1.6!important;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.pinyin{color:#625540;font-size:15px}.translation,.intention{color:#52634f}.callback{border-left:3px solid #c19850;padding:8px 12px;background:#efe4c9}button{font:inherit;min-height:44px;color:#254332;background:#fffdf7;border:2px solid #9ba991;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 13px;margin:4px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 2px 0 #c9c5b4}button:hover{background:#eee8cc;border-color:#446e4e}button:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b46a27;outline-offset:3px}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}button[data-key=check],button[data-key=continue],button[data-key=next]{background:#285d42;color:#fff;border-color:#285d42}.sentence{display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;min-height:72px;background:#eee7d4;border:2px dashed #a2ad94;border-radius:12px;padding:9px;margin:12px 0}.sentence button{font-size:23px;margin:2px}.empty{font-size:14px;color:#6b745f}.chunks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}.chunks button{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;min-width:68px;font-size:23px}.chunks small{font-size:12px;color:#59654b}.feedback{background:#e7ead7;padding:12px;border-radius:8px}.response{border-left:4px solid #b9853a;padding:12px}.aside{margin-top:16px}details{margin:12px 0;font-size:14px}summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:32px}.receipt{border-top:1px solid #c5cab8}.receipt small{display:inline-block;color:#47624a}.keyboard-help{display:block;color:#68715f;margin-top:14px}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}@media(max-width:460px){.dialogue{padding:16px}.scene-art{height:165px}.portrait-crop{right:8%;height:154px;width:77px}.portrait{height:154px;width:231px;left:calc(var(--person) * -77px)}.dialogue h1{font-size:22px}.chunks button{font-size:21px;padding:8px;min-width:56px}.keyboard-help{display:none}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}

.scene-art{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2}.dialogue>button{font-size:13px;padding:8px 10px}.dialogue details{margin:6px 0}.dialogue h1{margin-bottom:10px}@media(max-width:460px){.scene-art{height:125px}.portrait-crop{height:120px;width:60px}.portrait{height:120px;width:180px;left:calc(var(--person) * -60px)}.dialogue{padding:12px 16px}.dialogue h1{font-size:20px}.dialogue p{margin:6px 0}.dialogue h2{margin-top:14px}.place{padding:5px 10px;top:12px;left:12px;font-size:12px}}

/* SugarCube’s stowed sidebar otherwise reserves a left gutter on phones. */
#story,#ui-bar.stowed~#story{margin:0!important;padding:0!important}#passages{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}#ui-bar-tray{display:none!important}


